## Task ID Convention

Every task has an ID: `M{milestone}.{task}` (e.g., `M1.4`)

Used in: phase docs, PROGRESS.md, TRACEABILITY.md, git commits (`feat(M1.4): ...`), code comments (`// M1.4: ...`)

## Critical Rules

1. NEVER interpolate user input into shell commands
2. File operations use SFTP, not shell commands
3. Every parsed output is Zod-validated
4. All backend modules are Services in the ServiceContainer
5. Deterministic parsing preferred over LLM
6. Backend listens on localhost only
